	celebrate the return of film to the DeLUXE Theater!\nThis community event 
	is a cookout! You can expect family-friendly activities\, food trucks\, lo
	cal vendors\, and a double film screening!\nA Goofy Movie Screening: 12p\n
	Bad Boys Screening: 5p\n\nhttps://thedeluxetheater.com/events/outside-4-re
